Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:01.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Refining Sect ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:14.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Surround the outer sect gates,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one is allowed to leave !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:16.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This criminal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:17.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be executed on sight !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.48,0:02:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We don't know who did it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who could have caused such a commotion ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:25.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,No idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:30.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've fully recovered to the peak of Middle stage Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Origin Soul has also stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:34.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I still can't retrieve
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.12,0:02:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Heaven Defying Bead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who exactly is this person ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:41.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I know but don't report him,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:42.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might be implicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:56.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1390,587)\fad(300,000)}Wang Zhen\NSoul Refining Sect Inner disciple\NEarly stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone will be inspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Any suspicious movements,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:00.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you will be killed immediately !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:10.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the famous Soul Flag of the Soul Refining Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can learn this technique
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:14.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,and refine flags with wandering souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,the flags wouldn't be weaker than the Restriction Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.12,0:03:37.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spare me !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:39.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spare me !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Continue inspecting !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:48.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't him,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:49.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,why did he try to run away ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone can enter the Outer Soul Refining Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:54.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,so many disciples have a shady background.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.48,0:03:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are also spies
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,sent by other sects to learn about the Soul Flags.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But under a soul search,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,nothing can remain hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:07.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:07.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next person !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:09.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:10.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Move !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:11.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,He wasn't found out !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:18.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:20.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:21.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright, next.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:29.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The highest cultivation among these Inner disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,is only Early stage Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:32.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The intricacies of my restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,is beyond their comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.32,0:04:38.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,To think I could avoid the inner elders' inspection so easily...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:41.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, I didn't act rashly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:42.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be avoided at all costs...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aside from those with ulterior motives,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,nothing related to the matter of last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:04:59.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:01.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,the work of another sect ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.52,0:05:06.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:09.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sect competition is approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go prepare for it !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:13.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:16.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether it's the main Spirit Vein
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,or the Soul Flag refining method,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,they're all privileges for Inner disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:22.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to obtain the status of an inner disciple in this competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:36.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Having survived this near death experience
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,helped me gain some insight into my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:42.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although my cultivation has only recovered to Peak Late stage Nascent Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.52,0:05:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,the comprehension of my domain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:47.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,has broken through to Middle stage Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.12,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1647,557)\fad(300,000)}Wang Lin's avatar\NPeak Late stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:51.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can find that main Spirit Vein
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:52.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I can breakthrough again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:01.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:03.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,celestial spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:05.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,will have a limited effect on the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,To keep breaking it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:10.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll need another method.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.20,0:06:15.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Tea Domain left by Li Yuanfeng is at early stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it's already this powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:21.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,This means Soul Transformation cultivators can materialize their domains
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,far beyond what Soul Formation cultivators can achieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:35.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This aura is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:47.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm Liu Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:50.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you remember me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.80,0:06:52.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhuque Zi's disciple...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:54.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, you were that youth from the Heng Yue Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:59.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,you've actually become a Soul Refining Sect disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.32,0:07:01.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Centuries
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,aren't enough for you to quietly become the Suzaku's disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,you always were...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother is clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:17.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you came all this way to see me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.80,0:07:19.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,what exactly do you want ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:21.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't hide it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Mei approached you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.12,0:07:26.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,because I wanted to remember with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:27.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your bracelet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:29.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Butterfly had the same kind around her wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:32.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,She is too suspicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,her intentions are unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:35.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,She definitely harbors ill will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:37.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,That wasn't needed, farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:44.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,500 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,he was just an ignorant youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.48,0:07:48.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The current him
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.88,0:07:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,has a heart of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.12,0:07:54.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,But what is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.49,0:07:57.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,his Dao Heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:05.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(305,488)\fad(300,300)}Sect competition\NSoul Refining Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:14.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:17.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I surrender !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:21.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Surrendering
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:22.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,still means death !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:25.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems this competition
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.56,0:08:28.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,will claim many lives again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:31.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only one winner can enter the Inner sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course they'll fight desperately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.44,0:08:35.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll definitely win !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:36.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can do it !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:37.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go for it !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:20.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Death Spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each Soul Refining Sect competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,from the tens of thousands of outer disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,less than half survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such selection rules are unheard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,They seems to encourage mutual slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:38.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,There must be hidden reasons...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:40.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:42.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are making disciples kill each other
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.32,0:09:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,to collect their souls ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:48.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this competition's purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:50.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to collect souls for the Inner sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never thought that the Soul Refining Sect's strength
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:55.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,relied on such cruel means.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.48,0:10:02.56,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1663,454)\fad(300,300)}Final round
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,One with weird spells
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:10.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1611,592)\fad(300,300)}Si Ma\NSoul Refining Sect outer disciple\NLate stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,who is bloodthirsty by nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:12.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And one unremarkable
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,who stumbled into the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This year's finals
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:20.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,are really boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Begin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:25.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Middle stage Core Formation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.16,0:10:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've practiced this technique for decades,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,finally my wish will come true !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:33.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,you were lucky to reach the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,But meeting me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,is your fate !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.08,0:10:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:40.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Death Spell...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:42.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Condense !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:54.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your spell
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:56.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to kill cultivators of your level
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:58.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,in one strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:10:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know the Death Spell ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.36,0:11:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Death Spell can't fail !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This low-level spell
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,is just an imitation of the Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.40,0:11:13.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have a higher cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will kill instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if the gap in cultivation too wide,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:22.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,it backfires.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's your real cultivation ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1257,543)\fad(300,000)}Wu Daoqi\NSoul Refining Mountain Grand Elder\NPeak Late stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple Wang Zhen
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:40.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,greets Grand Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:43.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the competition winner,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:44.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Mu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:48.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did you counter
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:50.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Si Ma's Death Spell ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:53.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I concealed my cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm actually at Peak Late stage Core Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.12,0:11:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,so he couldn't harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:10.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,But by relying on a higher cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:14.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,you killed a talented prospect...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:15.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:18.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will handle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:20.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple obeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:25.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations Junior Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,for winning
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:28.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Soul Refining Sect competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will come
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:31.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,to Inner sect with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:41.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,These 3 mountains belong to the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:43.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(652,462)}Soul Refining Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Refining,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:45.60,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(656,472)\fad(300,000)}Soul Extracting Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:45.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Extracting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Soul Sealing factions of the Inner sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Inner Spirit Vein
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:47.96,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1627,467)}Soul Sealing Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,has such abundant spiritual energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.64,0:12:53.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can Senior Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:55.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,tell me about Soul Flags ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:56.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.72,0:13:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Flags gain strength
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:03.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,the more souls there are in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ten and Hundred-Soul Flags common.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:09.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you can create a Thousand-Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will gain special spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.84,0:13:15.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a Thousand-Soul Flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I made it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:18.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,with 1000 souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,To refine a Thousand-Soul Flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:24.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will need a primary soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:25.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its strength
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.36,0:13:29.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,must exceed that of all others souls combined.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The more powerful it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:34.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,the more souls can be sealed in the flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The souls sealed in the flag
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:37.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,will not dissipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.36,0:13:39.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the foundation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.92,0:13:43.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the Soul Flag refining method.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:46.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although on planet Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have seen other types of soul flags,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:50.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,compared to Soul Refining Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:52.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,they are completely worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,These 9 golden rings
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.72,0:13:59.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,are where 9 Soul Formation Elders cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:59.56,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1542,518)\fad(300,000)}Nine Golden Rings\NSoul Refining Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:01.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.56,0:14:02.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,have you heard of Ceng Niu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.64,0:14:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The one rumored to be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:07.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,the strongest under Soul Transformation on planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:08.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've heard about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:10.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Actually, our sect
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.52,0:14:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,originally had 10 Soul Formation cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.80,0:14:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Years ago, an Elder was traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and accidentally clashed with Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,he was killed by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:26.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,When did I kill a Soul Refining Sect's Soul Formation cultivator ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu disappeared at just the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:35.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor Du Tian was going to personally demand an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:37.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor Du Tian ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.24,0:14:39.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our Soul Refining Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,has 2 Soul Transformation Ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,These 2 blood rings
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:45.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,are where they cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:49.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor Du Tian's Billion-Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.32,0:14:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,could make even Zhuque Zi
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:54.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,think twice before acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:58.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are no teachers in the sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:15:00.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,we cultivate independently.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:03.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've been assigned to the Soul Refining Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:04.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,On this mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,you may choose any location
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,to establish your cultivation cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:11.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Inner disciple robes and token
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,are distributed in the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:14.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spells
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,are found in the scripture pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Senior Brother Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.76,0:15:25.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1395,492)\fad(300,000)}Scripture Pavilion\NSoul Refining Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:39.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Token ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.84,0:15:44.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:46.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The third floor is off limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:48.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you can browse freely
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.12,0:15:49.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,the other 2 floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:51.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, I want to know
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:53.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,where the Soul Flag manuals are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:15:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those aren't here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.56,0:15:59.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are you staring at ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only 10 Soul Flag jade slips exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,go steal one by force !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:06.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Steal it and it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you have the strength to kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,then kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:11.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,See something you like ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:11.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fancy a female cultivator ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:14.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:17.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take what you want by strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.84,0:16:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's the law of the Soul Refining Sect !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,No rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:22.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Complete freedom ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's quite an unusual sect...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brat
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're the fifth in 100 years
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.52,0:16:30.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,that has tried to attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:33.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, this old man will play with you !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:39.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandfather, please stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:42.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our Inner sect has another rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,A rule ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:45.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can steal,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:47.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,but if someone surrenders, don't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.16,0:16:53.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,there's a jade slip right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:16:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Refining Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:02.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,has gained another person not to be messed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,You destroyed my cave,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.24,0:17:16.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you looking for death ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:21.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each soul is strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:24.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,some even rival the pressure of Core Formation cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Soul Flag is good,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:31.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(211,458)\fad(200,000)}Hundred-Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.96,0:17:35.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.68,0:17:41.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I surrender !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.60,0:17:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I surrender...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:44.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jade slip, Soul Flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.40,0:17:45.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,they're yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:45.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1508,458)}Soul Refining jade slip
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have two concubines too,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:48.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,take them !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,By the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.48,0:17:51.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can't kill me !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.32,0:18:00.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,While it does contain Soul Flag refining methods,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:01.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,it seems
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:03.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,this jade is still incomplete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1399,585)\fad(300,000)}Xu Jun\NSoul Refining Sect Inner Disciple\NMiddle stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:05.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:07.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,did you notice that this Soul Flag method
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,is flawed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:12.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must be Qian Mu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,this year's outer disciple competition winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister Xu Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,greets Senior Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Flag refining method
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,is flawed because it's split into 3 parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:24.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're named after the 3 mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:25.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're called
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.12,0:18:27.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Refining,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:28.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Extracting,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.64,0:18:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Soul Sealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:31.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you combine all 3
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will get the true Soul Flag refining method.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:39.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't follow me !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:46.08,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1683,497)\fad(300,000)}Main Spirit Vein mine\NSoul Refining Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:07.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The main Spirit Vein's spiritual energy is so dense
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.92,0:19:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,that taking a little shouldn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:18.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,an ancient soul restriction ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.88,0:19:23.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It uses souls to create restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:25.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not only is it unpredictable,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:27.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it's even more powerful than ordinary restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:29.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This kind of restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:31.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,must hide a treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:37.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is soul energy inside it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.11,0:19:40.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I don't know if it's a treasure or a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I'm in this situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will take the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:47.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:07.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:31.61,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.61,0:20:33.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:35.27,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:42.75,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.99,0:20:42.75,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.75,0:20:50.35,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.99,0:20:50.35,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:57.91,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:57.91,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.23,0:21:01.23,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.51,0:21:01.23,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.52,0:21:04.95,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.35,0:21:04.95,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.51,0:21:09.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:12.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.11,0:21:16.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:20.51,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.51,0:21:20.51,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.67,0:21:25.47,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.23,0:21:25.47,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.48,0:21:28.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:31.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.51,0:21:36.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:39.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.59,0:21:44.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.68,0:21:49.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.03,0:21:53.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:58.47,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.51,0:21:58.47,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:01.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:06.43,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.44,0:22:09.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.87,0:22:14.43,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.43,0:22:18.39,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.39,0:22:21.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.27,0:22:25.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.15,0:22:28.43,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.71,0:22:33.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1500}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
